  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/12/P1240389.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(24 fotos) Vicent Rumeu, d&#39;Almenara, i Ren&eacute; Castillo, de Vinar&ograve;s han guanyat el campionat de billar de parelles escoceses cegues, que cada any per Nadal organitza el Caf&egrave; Druida, al carrer d&#39;Ausi&agrave;s March, 45 d&#39;Onda. Han participat 12 jugadors, emparellats entre ells segons la sort.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/billarparellesescocesesceguesdruida/p1240372.jpg\" alt=\"p1240372\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/billarparellesescocesesceguesdruida/p1240374.jpg\" alt=\"p1240374\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/billarparellesescocesesceguesdruida/p1240375.jpg\" alt=\"p1240375\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/billarparellesescocesesceguesdruida/p1240376.jpg\" alt=\"p1240376\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/billarparellesescocesesceguesdruida/p1240377.jpg\" alt=\"p1240377\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/billarparellesescocesesceguesdruida/p1240378.jpg\" alt=\"p1240378\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/billarparellesescocesesceguesdruida/p1240379.jpg\" alt=\"p1240379\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/billarparellesescocesesceguesdruida/p1240382.jpg\" alt=\"p1240382\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439ef